[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C08_BLUNDERBUSS]
Starlight’s Blunderbuss

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C08_BLUNDERBUSS_DESC]
Ever since losing her magic, Starlight Glimmer has carried a blunderbuss she bought on the black market in Manehattan.
She has yet to use the weapon, but she knows that if she ever needs it, it’s there.

[l_simp_chinese.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C08_BLUNDERBUSS]
星光的喇叭铳

[l_simp_chinese.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C08_BLUNDERBUSS_DESC]
自从失去魔法之后，星光熠熠就随身携带了一把马哈顿黑市买来的喇叭铳。
迄今为止，她还没有使用过这把武器，但是她知道，如果有一天她需要它，它就在那里。

